SUMMARY:OA - Wauna Inductions and Ceremonies Conference (WICC)
LOCATION:Camp Meriwether\, Cloverdale\, Oregon
DESCRIPTION:NOTE: No longer listed on scoutingevent.com - registration may
  be closed. Confirm with the organizer.\n\nCascade Pacific Council\nhttps
 ://global.scoutingevent.com/492-112006\n\n\n\nThe induction experience is
  one of the most important services the Order of the Arrow does for Scout
 ing. Attending WICC will provide training for those that want to create a
 n incredible Induction for our newest members. Ceremonialist\, Elangomats
 \, Induction staff and Advisers should attend this valuable weekend exper
 ience.\nWhen & Where\nSave the Date\nCamp Meriwether\nFriday 01-22-2027 6
 :00 PM PT to\nSunday 01-24-2027 11:00 AM PT\nMore Information\nMap of Eve
 nt\nCoords: 45.318604355980874\, -123.96150831
URL:https://global.scoutingevent.com/492-112006
END:VEVENT
