DESCRIPTION:Cascade Pacific Council\nhttps://global.scoutingevent.com/492-
 120003\n\n\n\nWeekend Horse Rides\nExperience the adventure of horsemansh
 ip with one of the largest horse herds in Scouting America. Our dedicated
