  year-round programs that foster responsibility\, empathy\, and confidenc
 e. Every ride is a chance to build character and bond with these incredib
 le animals. Discover the life-changing benefits of horseback riding on th
 e trail and beyond.\nLearn More on Our Website:\nHorse Programs Website\n
 Important 
URL:https://global.scoutingevent.com/492-120003
END:VEVENT
