DESCRIPTION:Cascade Pacific Council\nhttps://global.scoutingevent.com/492-
 121745\n\nRange Officer / Shooting Instructor\n\nNRA Co-Op Muzzleloading
  Instructor Training\nOne of the primary levels of supervision required 
 to conduct a Scouting America range whether it be a unit or a council lev
 el activity.\nAbout\nA Scouting America NRA Shotgun Instructor training 
 course certifies you to supervise council or unit Muzzleloading ranges. 
 The course cost does not include NRA credentialing fees.\nThe registratio
 n links on this page are for payment only as the NRA registration does no
 t have the ability to collect your course fees
URL:https://global.scoutingevent.com/492-121745
