SUMMARY:Training - Certified Angling Instructor Class (CAI) – Virtual Ni
 ght 1
LOCATION:Online Virtual Class\, Oregon
DESCRIPTION:Cascade Pacific Council\nhttps://global.scoutingevent.com/492-
 cai\n\nMerit Badge Counselor\, Range Officer / Shooting Instructor\n\nThi
 s course is designed to give Scouters tools and ideas to get Scouts fishi
 ng. We will ignite your desire for introducing Scouts to the wonderful wo
 rld of fishing.\nFishing with Scouts is an outdoor activity providing Sco
 uts with fun\, skills development\, family participation and strongly sup
 ports sound conservation awareness. And it's a "Thrifty" Scout activity. 
 Become a Certified Angling Instructor (CAI)\, and you can make fishing a 
 priority within your scouting world!\nWho:\nRegistered Scouting A
URL:https://global.scoutingevent.com/492-cai
